<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>⚠️ Demo Escape HTML</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-red-50 min-h-screen">
  <div class="bg-red-600 text-white text-center text-sm font-semibold py-2 px-4">
    ⚠️ HALAMAN INI SENGAJA NUNJUKIN OUTPUT GAK DI-ESCAPE, buat demo materi. JANGAN dipake di production.
  </div>
  <%- include('../partials/demo-nav', { title: '3. Escape HTML' }) %>

  <main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-800 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-6">
      Coba ketik <code>&lt;b&gt;tebal&lt;/b&gt;</code> atau
      <code>&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</code> di kotak bawah, terus liat
      hasilnya di 2 kotak — satu pake <code>&lt;%= %&gt;</code> (auto-escape),
      satu lagi pake <code>&lt;%- %&gt;</code> (raw/mentah).
    </div>

    <form method="GET" action="/demo/escape-html" class="flex gap-2 mb-6">
      <input
        type="text"
        name="input"
        value="<%= input %>"
        placeholder="<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>"
        class="flex-1 border border-red-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm"
      />
      <button class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Coba</button>
    </form>

    <% if (submitted) { %>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-green-300 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-600 mb-2">✅ Pake <code>&lt;%= input %&gt;</code> (auto-escape)</p>
          <div class="border border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded p-3 text-sm">
            <%= input %>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Kode HTML/JS yang kamu ketik ditampilin sebagai TEKS BIASA, gak keeksekusi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-red-300 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-600 mb-2">⚠️ Pake <code>&lt;%- input %&gt;</code> (raw, TIDAK di-escape)</p>
          <div class="border border-dashed border-red-300 rounded p-3 text-sm">
            <%- input %>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Kalo yang kamu ketik itu tag HTML/script, di sini dia BENERAN dirender/dieksekusi browser.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-6">
      Kode lengkap: <code>views/demo/escape-html.ejs</code> +
      <code>controllers/demo.unsafe.controller.js</code> (<code>escapeHtmlDemo</code>).
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
